2
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,030
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,350
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,160
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,060
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 17=

12
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,720
Beautiful Lady Lan,

13
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:18,080
drop the act.

14
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,880
I don't know what you're talking about.

15
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,320
Diviner Song, could it be

16
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,600
that you have feelings for me?

17
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:40,320
What exactly are you?

18
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,400
When did you come to the Chu State?

19
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:46,160
I'm Beautiful Lady Lan,
the King's woman.

20
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,560
Diviner Song...

21
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,280
Aren't I beautiful?

22
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,080
It's you?

23
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,160
What's wrong?

24
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,720
You know me?

25
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,880
Why aren't you dead yet?

26
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,480
What kind of demon are you?

27
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,600
Why did you break into
the Chu Royal Palace?

28
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,160
I've come

29
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:26,080
to destroy you all.

30
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,280
You're behind
all the dark arts in the city.

31
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,880
Dark arts?

32
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:35,000
I'm just granting the wishes

33
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,600
of those consumed by obsession.

34
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,080
Such kindness,

35
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,280
and you call that the dark arts?

36
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,960
How amusing.

37
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:46,360
If you don't reveal what you are now,

38
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,880
I'll kill you.

39
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,320
You can't kill me.

40
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,000
Wait.

41
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,760
Answer me this.

42
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,680
Do you only have memories
of this one lifetime?

43
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,360
How do you know that?

44
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:06,640
Could it be that you...

45
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,400
What do you mean?

46
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,600
I understand now.

47
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,640
Chu Li created all of this.

48
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,720
No wonder you know too.

49
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:22,200
So that's how it is.

50
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,280
Grand Shaman,

51
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,120
do it.

52
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,040
Run!

53
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:11,800
Does it hurt?

54
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:20,120
We finally found that person.

55
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:33,920
Thank you.

56
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,360
Thank you, Diviner Song.

57
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:41,600
I never expected

58
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,240
there would be two of them.

59
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,080
Good thing you killed Lanruo.

60
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,600
She may not die.

61
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,240
I only wounded her badly

62
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,880
to buy you some time.

63
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,880
But just when it mattered most,
my inner demon flared up again.

64
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,040
Otherwise,

65
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:59,080
I'd have found out who
that person in black was.

66
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:00,840
Grand Shaman,

67
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,080
your inner demon...

68
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,320
Get out.

69
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,000
Grand Shaman,

70
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,360
can I help you?

71
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,960
No one can help me.

72
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,400
Get out!

73
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,720
I'm sorry.

74
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,080
I'm sorry.

75
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,720
I'm sorry.

76
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,240
Mother!

77
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,440
Song Ziyuan!

78
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,640
Grand Shaman.

79
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,480
Grand Shaman!

80
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,000
(Don't come closer!)

81
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,680
Song Ziyuan.

82
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:26,920
What's wrong?

83
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:36,960
What happened?

84
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:44,600
I just

85
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,200
had a nightmare.

86
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,160
It was only a dream.

87
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,720
Don't worry.

88
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:54,880
In my previous life,

89
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,720
I was driven out of Jinan City,

90
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:59,200
so I don't know what happened after.

91
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,440
Do you remember, in my previous life,

92
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:04,280
why the Grand Shaman
passed her title to Yun Hua?

93
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,360
The Grand Shaman was in seclusion
then too.

94
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,920
She claimed to be unwell.

95
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,760
Later, she passed the title to Yun Hua.

96
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,600
I can't shake the feeling

97
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,000
that something's off about her.

98
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:18,800
You

99
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,160
still want to take her with you?

100
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,240
Since she despises me so much,

101
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,960
why should I force it?

102
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:27,760
I just want

103
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,080
to see her one last time,

104
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,080
to let go of this obsession.

105
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,720
All right.

106
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,400
I'll go with you.

107
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,560
How did this happen?

108
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,160
Why are you back again?

109
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,160
Yun Hua,

110
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,800
what on earth happened?

111
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,440
How did it come to this?

112
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,400
Where is everyone else?

113
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,680
None of your business.

114
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,880
If you don't tell me,

115
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,200
I won't leave.

116
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:03,720
Chu Li,

117
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,400
now I finally understand

118
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,480
why you keep hanging around.

119
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:11,480
So you're the Grand Shaman's daughter.

120
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,080
She...

121
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,280
She told you?

122
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,280
How else would I know?

123
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,960
The Grand Shaman
specifically instructed me

124
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:23,360
never to let you
return to the Shaman Clan.

125
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,400
You're a disgrace to her.

126
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,080
You...

127
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:29,960
She's provoking you.

128
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,080
What now?

129
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,080
You want to humiliate yourself further?

130
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,680
Do you want

131
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,760
the Grand Shaman to come out
and drive you away herself?

132
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,360
Yun Hua was just trying to provoke you.

133
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:58,840
Don't take it to heart.

134
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,000
No.

135
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,280
The Grand Shaman has always

136
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,320
kept our relationship a secret.

137
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,760
Yet she told this secret

138
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,920
to Yun Hua.

139
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,360
Does she favor Yun Hua that much
and despise me?

140
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,280
And here I was,
always worrying about her.

141
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,720
I won't think about her anymore.

142
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,280
Now, as she wishes...

143
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,800
I have nothing to do with her anymore.

144
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,480
(Grand Shaman,)

145
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,080
(I will guard it for you.)

146
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,280
By the way,

147
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:32,080
I haven't seen Fusheng these past days.

148
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,320
Where did he go?

149
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:34,960
Chu Li, I'm here.

150
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,240
Fusheng,

151
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,680
where have you been?

152
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,560
Aren't we leaving Jinan City soon?

153
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:45,320
I thought I'd buy some things
for the trip.

154
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,320
What if

155
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,120
we never come back?

156
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,920
How could we not come back?

157
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,400
Of course we'll come back.

158
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,760
Right?

159
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:57,960
You're hurt?

160
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:03,160
I probably bought too many things.

161
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,200
I'm just tired.

162
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,400
I can barely lift my arm.

163
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,080
What did you buy?

164
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,720
Show me. Come on.

165
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:20,860
(Song Residence)

166
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,360
You're awake?

167
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:37,800
Why are you here so early?

168
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:39,880
You said it yourself.

169
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,800
Every time we meet,

170
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,080
that's one more time together.

171
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:49,450
♪Moonlight spills over
gray tiles and walls♪

172
00:11:49,450 --> 00:11:53,560
♪Wind chimes sway, evoking old times♪

173
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,880
Song Ziyuan,

174
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:58,000
from this moment on,

175
00:11:58,520 --> 00:11:59,400
every single day,

176
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,800
let's never be apart, alright?

177
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:04,240
♪Red threads wind through a few lines
of the book of fate♪

178
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:04,960
Alright.

179
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,000
Let's cherish every day.

180
00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:11,560
♪No mountain or sea can bar the way♪

181
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:17,250
♪I'd burn through every lifetime
to be with you♪

182
00:12:17,250 --> 00:12:21,470
♪Countless blades and a river of stars
fall into your cool gaze♪

183
00:12:21,470 --> 00:12:25,550
♪An echo of our first meeting
at the edge of chaos♪

184
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:27,220
♪Like vines, love♪

185
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:33,170
♪Brews the years
into moonlight in your eyes♪

186
00:12:33,170 --> 00:12:37,500
♪Through three lifetimes, hand in hand,
we walk into oblivion♪

187
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:41,550
♪Gray-haired, fingers entwined,
we still gaze at each other♪

188
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:48,500
♪Sun and moon may turn, our vow remains♪
(Tombstone)

189
00:13:01,150 --> 00:13:05,240
♪Red threads wind through a few lines
of the book of fate♪

190
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:09,150
♪Yet one passionate look undoes it all♪
(Chu Li)

191
00:13:09,150 --> 00:13:11,550
♪No mountain or sea can bar the way♪

192
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,240
Why are you taking apart

193
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:14,840
those bamboo slips one by one?

194
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,320
Pay attention.

195
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:21,470
♪Swords and stars fill your cool gaze♪
(Chu Li)

196
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,760
This is my name?

197
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:26,920
Got it?

198
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,200
Then how do you write your name?

199
00:13:33,170 --> 00:13:37,500
♪Through three lifetimes, hand in hand,
we walk into oblivion♪

200
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:41,550
♪Gray-haired, fingers entwined,
we still gaze at each other♪

201
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,320
That's so hard to write.

202
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,560
Then write it a few more times.

203
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,600
Why did you let go?

204
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:07,560
Why don't you pay attention?

205
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,720
You're so close to me.

206
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:12,480
How can I concentrate?

207
00:14:16,930 --> 00:14:17,380
Hah!

208
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,680
You know me.

209
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:20,880
I always get even.

210
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,240
Okay, okay!

211
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,080
I'll wipe it off for you, okay?

212
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,480
How petty.

213
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:59,830
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

214
00:15:00,130 --> 00:15:06,910
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

215
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:10,610
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

216
00:15:10,610 --> 00:15:14,170
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

217
00:15:14,170 --> 00:15:20,220
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

218
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:22,560
Stop looking.

219
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,480
No matter how long you look,
she'll never be yours.

220
00:15:32,350 --> 00:15:39,090
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

221
00:15:39,510 --> 00:15:46,170
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

222
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:49,870
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

223
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:53,240
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

224
00:15:53,560 --> 00:16:00,220
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

225
00:16:00,650 --> 00:16:07,300
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

226
00:16:07,590 --> 00:16:13,960
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

227
00:16:14,130 --> 00:16:17,560
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

228
00:16:17,820 --> 00:16:21,030
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

229
00:16:21,070 --> 00:16:27,950
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

230
00:16:28,310 --> 00:16:31,840
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

231
00:16:31,990 --> 00:16:35,560
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

232
00:16:35,950 --> 00:16:42,400
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

233
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:17,970
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

234
00:17:18,230 --> 00:17:24,520
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
